 - Viewport emulation set by a CDP script that gets killed (SIGTERM) can linger at 375px even after `clearDeviceMetricsOverride` from a new session. Fix: in a fresh session send `setDeviceMetricsOverride{width:0,height:0,deviceScaleFactor:0,mobile:false}` then `clearDeviceMetricsOverride`, and confirm `window.innerWidth` is back to 1600. Kill the emulation process by PID (`kill <pid>`), not `pkill -f` (self-match kills your shell).
 - `GET /api/auth/me` returns `{user:{id,name,created_at,has_password,last_used_at}}` — the user id (`u_…`) is what the D1 `users.id` / `notes.user_id` zero-row check needs; grab it via the page's own token before 注销, since the token is dead afterwards.
 
+## R311 multi-account Day1 UX audit (fold / verbatim / cleanup)
+- Fold classification is NOT deterministic per content shape across accounts: in R311 prod, `ssh …`, `curl … | bash`, `curl -s https://…/health` and a domain-only `wiki.corp-demo.internal … :3000` memo folded (the domain memo even as strict 「含可执行命令」), while `kubectl logs …` and every bare `IP:port` note stayed unfolded. Always reload once ~15s after entry before judging; record per-note fold state in a table rather than asserting "technical ⇒ folded".
+- A note containing the word 「密码」 (even "密码在群置顶，别写这里") can be pre-flagged client-side as 敏感 (`••••` encrypted card) and then flip to a plain unfolded 资料 card after server triage — screenshot both states, it is not a render bug.
+- Compound questions (「A 是哪天？B 花了多少？」) get routed to the expense-stats path if any half looks like a money query and the other half is silently dropped — ask one fact per question when measuring "benign-answer usefulness".
+- Benign technical questions are the false-positive hot spot: asking for an internal wiki *address* can return the whole `〔已隔离危险命令…〕` block; asking where nginx listens replaces the IP with `〔原文片段略…〕` while keeping the port (`exec_gate: gate:primitive:hostport`). Keep one domain-only and one IP:port memo per account to reproduce.
+- Token capture without devtools: 设置 → 账号 → 「复制我的 API token」 then `xclip -selection clipboard -o > /tmp/tok`. Hit `GET /api/auth/me` (with a real Chrome UA header, Cloudflare rejects curl's default) to log `user.id` BEFORE 注销, then re-run after for the 401. 注销 confirm input accepted a plain clipboard Ctrl+V of 「注销」 this run (no React-safe setter needed); the red 「永久注销」 button enables immediately.
+- `shred -u` the /tmp password/token files at the end and copy only screenshots + `me_*.json` (no token) into `backend/scripts/qa-r311/out/ui-evidence/` for the auditor.
